  "result": "Perfect! All 206 tests pass \u2713\n\n**Added late fee calculation to src/reports.js**\n\n**New function:**\n- `lateFee(invoice, asOf)` \u2014 calculates interest on overdue payments\n  - Returns 0 if invoice is not overdue (dueDate \u2265 asOf)\n  - Formula: (amount due) \u00d7 0.04% \u00d7 (days overdue)\n    - 0.04% per day = 0.0004 decimal rate\n    - daysOverdue = daysBetween(dueDate, asOf)\n    - amount due = balanceDue(invoice)\n  - Returns fee rounded to cents\n  - Accounts for partial payments (reduced due amount means reduced fee)\n\n**Tests added: 10 tests covering**\n- No fee if not overdue (on due date or before)\n- Fee calculation for 1 day overdue\n- Exact formula validation\n- Fee increases proportionally with days overdue\n- Fee reduced by partial payments\n- No fee for paid invoices (zero balance)\n- Input immutability\n- Correct rounding to cents\n- Larger invoice amounts produce larger fees",
